TEXT 1672 6432 Left 2 ;Q14/Q12/Q9/Q10: over-voltage protection, but doesn't work too well.\nwhile it does prevent the output from turning on,\nthe pumpued inductor current still needs to reach 0, which can\ndrive the output voltage way too high.
